SOAPBOX: Experienced wildly varying propagation conditions from Saturday mid-day on till the end. Lots of QSB on the other end and a few lost QSOs as a result. The station performed well despite some minor issues with plumbing directly above the operating position and some minor water spillage onto the rotor controllers and transceivers. Thanks to the sponsors and all the guys and gals at the other end of the QSOs for a great weekend of radiosport!
